# Scene hl1-dome (test/README.md): hldemo1 dome entrance trigger
# (start_script_trigger -> startdometalk_mm / dometalk_mm): the dome scientists
# and barney's scripted talk seen from the dome view: uplink.route lines 27-31
# (SHOT start .. SHOT dome-scene). The intro room is skipped: the player is put
# where its teleport drops him.
# scene-window: uplink start dome-scene
startmap hldemo1
waitmap hldemo1 60
setpos -2048 744 36
wait 2
stats begin
setpos -2048 -496 70 0 270
wait 4
setpos -2000 -620 196 0 270
wait 26
shot dome-scene
stats end
wait 0.2
pass
